WEBVTT

00:00:10.611 --> 00:00:16.884
Abiru hodo dakiattari kuchizuke shitari

00:00:16.884 --> 00:00:23.090
Abiru hodo kenka shitari aishiattari

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:29.296
Ari no mama omae no koto shiritai kuse ni

00:00:29.296 --> 00:00:35.035
Ari no mama nante narenai ore no hou sa

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:38.171
Wakaranai

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:40.908
Omae no kokoro ga

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:42.910
Nazedayo

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:47.548
Honto wa majutsushi kai?

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:51.718
Dakishimetai

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:55.322
Hitori ja cry

00:00:55.322 --> 00:00:59.993
Mou nido to hitori ja itakunai

00:01:01.328 --> 00:01:04.331
Dakishimetai

00:01:04.331 --> 00:01:07.634
Omae to fly

00:01:08.035 --> 00:01:15.409
Marude naiteru youna kanjiteru koe ni toketeiku

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:21.915
Serenade

00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:02.956
Farewell, Childman.

00:02:04.458 --> 00:02:05.525
Azalie...

00:02:30.584 --> 00:02:36.590
the shrimp man
COMeES again

00:02:42.596 --> 00:02:44.131
That's it!

00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:49.302
Put your back into it!

00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:51.471
Come on, come on!

00:02:51.471 --> 00:02:54.107
Go for it, Youngster! Come on!

00:02:55.042 --> 00:02:56.543
There, right there!

00:02:59.746 --> 00:03:01.014
Go for it!

00:03:03.583 --> 00:03:06.586
Yeah, that's it}

00:03:06.586 --> 00:03:07.888
<i>Got</i>

00:03:08.188 --> 00:03:10.390
Come on, Youngster!

00:03:19.466 --> 00:03:21.068
That's it!

00:03:21.068 --> 00:03:23.804
You got it, you got it!

00:03:24.237 --> 00:03:25.972
Oh, hey!

00:03:27.307 --> 00:03:29.409
All right, that's good!

00:03:29.976 --> 00:03:31.678
Go! Go, go!

00:03:32.913 --> 00:03:34.548
Come on, come on!

00:03:35.015 --> 00:03:36.616
It's like a cat playing with a mouse.

00:03:37.718 --> 00:03:40.587
Give it up. I've won this match!

00:03:41.354 --> 00:03:44.558
I'm the type of guy who never knows
when to give up, you see.

00:03:45.058 --> 00:03:46.493
Master!

00:03:46.827 --> 00:03:48.462
That's it, that's it!

00:03:55.102 --> 00:03:56.336
Wow!

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:57.904
Wow, that's awesome!

00:03:59.773 --> 00:04:01.942
Way to go, Youngster!

00:04:24.831 --> 00:04:28.335
It has been two days since
Bloody August's struggle with death,

00:04:28.335 --> 00:04:32.205
and still Childman sleeps
as though he was slain.

00:04:32.205 --> 00:04:35.675
According to the reports,
Childman lost his chance of victory

00:04:35.675 --> 00:04:38.345
due to Krylancelo's foolish antics.

00:04:38.912 --> 00:04:42.082
Our patience is near its end.

00:04:42.082 --> 00:04:45.986
Lai is divining his whereabouts.

00:04:46.787 --> 00:04:48.321
Flameheart...

00:04:49.022 --> 00:04:49.890
Yes!

00:04:50.223 --> 00:04:53.794
You will depart from the
Tower of Fangs tomorrow morning

00:04:54.661 --> 00:04:58.298
to capture the traitor, Krylancelo.

00:04:58.698 --> 00:05:00.700
Leave it to me.

00:05:19.452 --> 00:05:20.287
Lai!

00:05:20.687 --> 00:05:22.489
Stop this stupidity!

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:27.194
You're planning to go where
Krylancelo is, aren't you?

00:05:29.329 --> 00:05:31.298
Please overlook this, Lai!

00:05:31.298 --> 00:05:34.267
| must relate the Elders' decision to him!

00:05:34.501 --> 00:05:36.269
Don't you know?

00:05:36.269 --> 00:05:40.240
Your actions are considered
traitorous to the Tower of Fangs!

00:05:40.607 --> 00:05:43.343
| know that a hundred times over!

00:05:55.288 --> 00:05:57.023
Reconsider, Hartia!

00:05:57.023 --> 00:05:59.759
That's it! At least wait until Master wakes up.

00:05:59.759 --> 00:06:02.462
| can't. There isn't that much time.

00:06:02.462 --> 00:06:05.232
If they catch Krylancelo, it will be too late!

00:06:08.668 --> 00:06:09.769
| beg you.

00:06:14.007 --> 00:06:16.176
These are the results of the latest divination.

00:06:17.644 --> 00:06:18.645
Lai...

00:06:20.180 --> 00:06:23.884
On the condition that you are
only going to warn Krylancelo.

00:06:23.884 --> 00:06:25.652
Don't make the mistake of getting in too deep.

00:06:26.052 --> 00:06:27.554
| promise.

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:48.842
Them? They set out early
this morning in a carriage.

00:06:49.409 --> 00:06:50.410
Carriage?

00:06:51.144 --> 00:06:53.413
You see, in an arm wrestling contest,

00:06:53.413 --> 00:06:57.450
| said if he won, I'd let him have my old one.

00:06:57.651 --> 00:07:00.120
That guy is strong. No doubt about it.

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:02.355
And which way did they go?

00:07:02.656 --> 00:07:06.159
Give it up. The Western Mountains
are dangerous right now.

00:07:06.159 --> 00:07:09.195
They say that the villagers have
already evacuated the foothills.

00:07:09.195 --> 00:07:11.431
| warned them too, but...

00:07:13.533 --> 00:07:14.701
West?

00:07:20.807 --> 00:07:25.111
At this rate, we'll be at that
Row person's place in no time!

00:07:25.111 --> 00:07:28.949
This book is pretty old.
Is that person still alive?

00:07:32.819 --> 00:07:34.988
Geez, you did it to yourself!

00:07:38.558 --> 00:07:39.559
What's wrong?

00:07:39.559 --> 00:07:41.361
It's another earthquake!

00:07:44.331 --> 00:07:46.333
Is this really all right?

00:07:46.333 --> 00:07:48.868
Seems it would be best if we hurried.

00:08:05.986 --> 00:08:08.588
It looks like they evacuated in a hurry.

00:08:08.588 --> 00:08:10.590
We don't need to stay here long, either.

00:08:12.125 --> 00:08:13.626
Wait! There!

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:19.366
Stay here. I'll go look.

00:08:28.975 --> 00:08:30.777
How does it look?

00:08:38.685 --> 00:08:40.020
What's that sound?

00:08:40.453 --> 00:08:46.526
If it erupts this time, the flowing lava
will probably decimate this village.

00:08:46.526 --> 00:08:48.528
Why don't you guys evacuate?

00:08:48.895 --> 00:08:50.997
Well you see how old we are.

00:08:50.997 --> 00:08:53.199
Our bodies don't work so well.

00:08:53.199 --> 00:08:55.735
It's too much for us to walk to safety.

00:08:55.735 --> 00:08:57.404
And then, you see...

00:09:00.106 --> 00:09:02.242
Puppies will soon be born.

00:09:02.242 --> 00:09:06.046
Poor thing, she was abandoned.

00:09:06.379 --> 00:09:08.014
Hurry and get ready.

00:09:08.248 --> 00:09:10.683
Qur carriage is outside.

00:09:11.051 --> 00:09:13.253
The dog too. Hurry.

00:09:14.687 --> 00:09:16.222
Hurry, Big Brother!

00:09:16.923 --> 00:09:19.426
If we leave them, they'll just spoil.

00:09:21.528 --> 00:09:23.296
The volcano's going to erupt!

00:09:23.296 --> 00:09:24.798
What Volcano?

00:09:24.798 --> 00:09:28.935
The Battle Hound of Mazmaturia,
Sir Volcan Polkano, will be his opponent!

00:09:28.935 --> 00:09:31.805
Bring that Volcano guy over here!

00:09:32.272 --> 00:09:34.040
I'm begging you, stand up!

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:37.710
No way. I'm so full, I can't walk a step, so there.

00:09:38.912 --> 00:09:40.246
Big Brother, there!

00:09:41.481 --> 00:09:43.883
Heaven's on my side, now!

00:09:47.654 --> 00:09:48.955
It's coming from in here.

00:09:48.955 --> 00:09:50.824
| wonder if there's a monster living in there?

00:10:06.372 --> 00:10:08.007
Yah! Yah!
You can't, Big Brother!

00:10:08.007 --> 00:10:09.209
Wait!

00:10:10.877 --> 00:10:12.312
Volcan! Dortin!

00:10:12.312 --> 00:10:13.746
Master!

00:10:15.882 --> 00:10:17.784
Why did you leave the carriage?!

00:10:36.136 --> 00:10:41.141
That Volcano! If I only had a big pot,
I'd mix him to death!

00:10:41.374 --> 00:10:43.009
You're heavy, Big Brother!

00:10:43.309 --> 00:10:45.512
Even if you die, don't let go!

00:10:45.512 --> 00:10:47.280
I'm at my limit...

00:10:58.925 --> 00:11:00.193
It's pretty beat up.

00:11:00.193 --> 00:11:04.297
It broke some time ago,
and it's been in storage ever since.

00:11:06.699 --> 00:11:08.501
Help me, Majic.

00:11:08.735 --> 00:11:12.539
I'm grateful for how you feel,
but don't bother with us.

00:11:12.539 --> 00:11:14.541
Hurry up and evacuate, please!

00:11:14.541 --> 00:11:17.177
We can't leave the two of you.

00:11:17.810 --> 00:11:21.514
Even if you're able to fix the carriage,
there isn't a horse to pull it.

00:11:22.048 --> 00:11:24.484
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:28.588
There's this story...

00:11:28.588 --> 00:11:34.027
A dead sorcerer's soul can curse
an enemy they had a grudge against.

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:35.695
Curse?

00:11:35.695 --> 00:11:37.430
Go find the horse that ran away!

00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:39.265
If you want me to stay alive, that is.

00:11:39.265 --> 00:11:42.101
I-it's a lie! A bluff!

00:11:42.101 --> 00:11:43.102
<i>Got</i>

00:11:43.102 --> 00:11:44.571
I'll remember this!

00:11:45.004 --> 00:11:47.674
That story you told just now, is it true?

00:11:47.674 --> 00:11:49.475
Mister!

00:11:50.276 --> 00:11:51.945
The dog! It's bad!

00:12:26.879 --> 00:12:28.881
It seems everyone has evacuated, already.

00:12:29.449 --> 00:12:31.784
Is Krylancelo really around here somewhere?

00:12:32.752 --> 00:12:34.587
You're in the way, Shrimp Man!

00:12:36.589 --> 00:12:37.690
Wait, I know her!

00:12:37.924 --> 00:12:40.059
Don't call me Shrimp Man!

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:43.463
| am the assassin who lives in the night.

00:12:43.463 --> 00:12:47.100
| have a covenant with the night
and by day, I live hiding my face.

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:50.336
I'm sorry, but I don't have time to play with you!

00:12:50.703 --> 00:12:53.039
You're in the way, Shrimp Man!

00:12:53.039 --> 00:12:54.874
How many times do I have to say it
before you understand?

00:12:54.874 --> 00:12:56.175
My name is...

00:12:56.175 --> 00:12:57.310
Okay, hold this.

00:12:57.310 --> 00:12:59.145
...not Shrimp Man, but...

00:12:59.145 --> 00:13:00.713
Do you want Orphen?

00:13:00.713 --> 00:13:04.250
Yes, that's right. It's very urgent.
| need to see him, and tell him something.

00:13:05.618 --> 00:13:07.320
What are you going to use this stuff for?

00:13:07.320 --> 00:13:08.521
A baby!

00:13:08.521 --> 00:13:09.622
A baby?

00:13:10.857 --> 00:13:13.059
A baby's about to be born.

00:13:14.427 --> 00:13:17.263
To Krylancelo? A baby?

00:13:25.838 --> 00:13:27.140
I've brought them!

00:13:27.140 --> 00:13:28.708
Thank you for the hard work.

00:13:28.941 --> 00:13:30.009
Krylancelo!

00:13:33.012 --> 00:13:34.080
Quietly!

00:13:40.620 --> 00:13:41.654
A dog!

00:13:42.755 --> 00:13:43.723
Shrimp Man!

00:13:47.327 --> 00:13:50.296
Your explanation wasn't clear enough.

00:13:50.763 --> 00:13:55.234
After all, why a rattle for a puppy?

00:13:57.804 --> 00:14:00.239
Watch the volcano, Shrimp Man!

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:02.709
Shrimp! Shrimp! SHRIMP!

00:14:03.343 --> 00:14:05.712
I'm the Black Tiger!

00:14:18.458 --> 00:14:19.559
Got to hurry!

00:14:19.559 --> 00:14:20.259
Yes!

00:14:30.002 --> 00:14:33.373
It's no use. The horse left the village
a long time ago.

00:14:33.373 --> 00:14:38.010
Dortin, you don't mind being
cursed to death by that evil sorcerer?

00:14:38.378 --> 00:14:40.313
I'm not the one that's
going to be cursed to death!

00:14:40.313 --> 00:14:42.715
It's you that he's got
a grudge against, Big Brother!

00:14:43.816 --> 00:14:47.186
What did you say, Dortin?!
What did you just say?

00:14:47.186 --> 00:14:48.588
Big Brother, there!

00:14:51.624 --> 00:14:52.725
It's a moa.

00:14:52.725 --> 00:14:53.626
Moa?

00:14:53.993 --> 00:14:56.929
Yeah, a kind of flightless bird.

00:14:56.929 --> 00:15:00.867
It can't fly, but its legs are unbelievably fast.

00:15:01.701 --> 00:15:04.704
Okay! We can't talk luxury here, at this point.

00:15:04.704 --> 00:15:06.372
We're going to catch it.

00:15:15.314 --> 00:15:16.416
Success!

00:15:17.016 --> 00:15:18.151
Dortin!

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:32.331
Master!

00:15:32.331 --> 00:15:33.499
Continue the repairs!

00:15:44.243 --> 00:15:45.244
O Ice!

00:15:52.552 --> 00:15:53.553
O Ice!

00:15:57.857 --> 00:15:58.858
Hurry!

00:15:59.459 --> 00:16:01.561
Try hard, now! Try hard!

00:16:02.261 --> 00:16:03.429
Done!

00:16:04.997 --> 00:16:06.299
No horse, yet?

00:16:06.299 --> 00:16:08.234
I'll go look too.

00:16:15.641 --> 00:16:18.211
Majic, hook her up to the carriage!

00:16:18.211 --> 00:16:19.445
Yes!

00:16:19.445 --> 00:16:21.013
Please lend us your strength.

00:16:26.018 --> 00:16:27.019
Dear!

00:16:27.019 --> 00:16:28.187
You did well.

00:16:28.187 --> 00:16:29.489
Cute!

00:16:30.289 --> 00:16:31.390
Heading out!

00:16:47.773 --> 00:16:48.841
You are?

00:16:49.141 --> 00:16:52.778
As per command of the Tower of Fangs,
| have come to retrieve the traitorous one.

00:16:53.346 --> 00:16:54.847
Flameheart...

00:16:55.815 --> 00:16:58.818
How admirable, you've remembered me.

00:16:59.986 --> 00:17:01.320
Trade places, Majic!

00:17:01.921 --> 00:17:03.356
And you, Master?

00:17:03.823 --> 00:17:05.358
Don't worry about me.

00:17:05.725 --> 00:17:07.527
But, Master!

00:17:07.527 --> 00:17:08.794
Orphen!

00:17:08.794 --> 00:17:10.196
It's all right already! Go!

00:17:10.196 --> 00:17:10.897
Yes...

00:17:26.045 --> 00:17:27.380
llusion!

00:17:37.957 --> 00:17:39.959
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:03.316
OUCH! Ouch! Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!

00:18:06.385 --> 00:18:11.057
As per orders, I'll take you back
to the Tower of Fangs.

00:18:12.792 --> 00:18:17.029
But I wasn't told I have to
take you back alive, you see.

00:18:38.117 --> 00:18:39.051
You!

00:18:39.352 --> 00:18:40.553
Who are you?!

00:18:41.287 --> 00:18:44.023
| am the assassin who lives in the night.

00:18:44.423 --> 00:18:48.494
| have a covenant with the night
and by day, I live hiding my face.

00:18:48.761 --> 00:18:50.963
| am the embodiment of fear and evil!

00:18:50.963 --> 00:18:54.066
Of the House of Demonic Dreams,
my name is...

00:18:56.702 --> 00:18:58.571
Open transport!

00:18:58.571 --> 00:18:59.572
To the other side!

00:18:59.572 --> 00:19:01.674
Towers of Heaven, that dance around me!

00:19:25.665 --> 00:19:26.832
Hartia...

00:19:40.446 --> 00:19:45.217
Krylancelo, the pursuit from
the Tower of Fangs will not cease.

00:19:45.685 --> 00:19:46.686
Don't die.

00:19:47.687 --> 00:19:49.522
We're going home, Elizabeth.

00:20:04.203 --> 00:20:06.439
What? Childman's awakened?

00:20:51.917 --> 00:20:53.419
| feel it.

00:20:53.686 --> 00:20:57.690
| can feel the pleasant sensations of the skin.

00:20:58.157 --> 00:21:00.226
Each cell, one by one...

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:03.829
How many years has it been
since I've last felt this?

00:21:06.899 --> 00:21:09.602
I am human.

00:21:30.022 --> 00:21:32.324
Master, the Elders call.

00:21:33.526 --> 00:21:34.627
Master?

00:21:34.627 --> 00:21:36.362
Have them wait.

00:21:36.362 --> 00:21:37.363
But!

00:21:37.863 --> 00:21:38.931
Yes...

00:21:40.199 --> 00:21:41.300
Lai...

00:21:43.035 --> 00:21:44.537
right now he's...

00:21:45.271 --> 00:21:47.139
Where is Krylancelo?

00:21:47.606 --> 00:21:52.578
Yes, according to the divination,
he's headed toward the Valley of Yuginia.

00:21:52.945 --> 00:21:55.014
What? Toward the Valley of Yuginia?

00:22:16.368 --> 00:22:17.937
It's just a little further.

00:22:17.937 --> 00:22:19.572
When we reach the Valley of Yuginia,

00:22:19.572 --> 00:22:22.408
Rocks Row, the possessor of
levitation and premonitory powers,

00:22:22.408 --> 00:22:24.777
will tell us the way to save Azalie.

00:22:25.044 --> 00:22:27.780
It's taken so long to reach this day.

00:22:28.681 --> 00:22:30.249
Hold on, Row!

00:22:30.249 --> 00:22:32.351
| have something I want to ask you!

00:22:32.351 --> 00:22:34.453
Don't die. Don't die, please!

00:22:34.787 --> 00:22:36.388
Next time on Sorcerous Stabber Orphen:

00:22:36.388 --> 00:22:38.557
the secret h1iooeEn I my SsWoORrRO
"The Secret Hidden in My Sword."

00:22:38.557 --> 00:22:40.860
The secret h1iooeEn I my SWoORrRO
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:22:40.860 --> 00:22:41.360
The secret h1iooeEn
I my SsWoORrRO

00:22:42.828 --> 00:22:44.363
Doushiyou

00:22:44.363 --> 00:22:46.765
Oikakete kurenakya

00:22:46.765 --> 00:22:51.003
Konomama zun zun to aruitatte

00:22:52.571 --> 00:22:54.139
Doushiyou

00:22:54.139 --> 00:22:56.575
Aenaku naru yo

00:22:56.575 --> 00:23:00.880
Keitai denwa o shittetatte

00:23:01.447 --> 00:23:06.318
Headlights watashi o terasu

00:23:06.318 --> 00:23:10.623
Mabushi sugite me o tojiru

00:23:11.257 --> 00:23:13.659
Heels nugisutete

00:23:13.659 --> 00:23:16.128
Ryoute ni moteba

00:23:16.128 --> 00:23:21.200
Pride nanka mo sutechaeru

00:23:21.367 --> 00:23:29.942
Hajimete sugoku hikyou na mo shisou na no yo

00:23:31.143 --> 00:23:41.820
Kono mama michi ni taorekonde nakijakuritai

00:23:42.755 --> 00:23:47.259
Looking for you and fall in love

00:23:47.993 --> 00:23:52.197
Tsuyoku mo so naindakara

00:23:52.932 --> 00:23:57.002
Ima kiss o saretara

00:23:57.736 --> 00:24:02.441
Naichauyo doushiyou

